{
  "version": 1,
  "level": "A1",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "a1-01-genre-nombre",
      "order": 1,
      "title": "Род и число существительных",
      "subtitle": "Masculin / Féminin, singulier / pluriel",
      "topics": [
        "genre",
        "nombre"
      ],
      "prereq": [],
      "minutes": 12,
      "theory": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "В французском два рода: masculin (мужской) и féminin (женский). Нет среднего рода. Число: singulier (ед. ч.) и pluriel (мн. ч.)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Признаки женского рода",
          "text": "Суффиксы: -tion, -sion, -té, -ence, -ance, -ie, -ure, -ade, -ee, -ette. Окончание -e во многих случаях."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Множественное число",
          "text": "Обычно +s: un livre → des livres. Исключения: -au/-eau → -aux, -al → -aux, -eu → -eux, -ou → -ous."
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "ref": "plural_patterns_fr"
        }
      ],
      "drills": [
        {
          "id": "a1-01-d01",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Le ____ (table) est grand.",
          "options": [
            "table",
            "tables"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "table"
          ],
          "why": "Singulier après le."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-01-d02",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Les ____ (livre) sont sur la table.",
          "options": [
            "livre",
            "livres"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "livres"
          ],
          "why": "Pluriel: livre → livres (+s)."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-01-d03",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Un ____ (château) magnifique.",
          "options": [
            "château",
            "châteaux"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "château"
          ],
          "why": "Singulier. Pluriel: châteaux."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-01-d04",
          "type": "fill",
          "prompt": "Des ____ (cheval) noirs.",
          "answer": [
            "chevaux"
          ],
          "why": "-al → -aux au pluriel."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-02-articles",
      "order": 2,
      "title": "Артикли: défini, indéfini",
      "subtitle": "le/la/l'/les — un/une/des",
      "topics": [
        "articles_definis",
        "articles_indefinis"
      ],
      "prereq": [
        "a1-01-genre-nombre"
      ],
      "minutes": 15,
      "theory": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Определённый артикль (le, la, l', les) = конкретный предмет. Неопределённый (un, une, des) = неконкретный, один из многих."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Определённый",
          "text": "le (m sg), la (f sg), l' (devant voyelle/h muet), les (pl)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Неопределённый",
          "text": "un (m sg), une (f sg), des (pl)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "ref": "articles_definite"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "ref": "articles_indefinite"
        }
      ],
      "drills": [
        {
          "id": "a1-02-d01",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "____ ami vient nous voir.",
          "options": [
            "Un",
            "Une",
            "Le",
            "La"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "Un"
          ],
          "why": "Ami = masculin, singulier, indéfini."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-02-d02",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "J'aime ____ musique.",
          "options": [
            "la",
            "le",
            "l'",
            "une"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "la"
          ],
          "why": "Musique = féminin, défini."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-02-d03",
          "type": "fill",
          "prompt": "____ eau est froide. (défini)",
          "answer": [
            "L'"
          ],
          "why": "Eau commence par voyelle → l'."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-02-d04",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Des ____ (fille) jouent.",
          "options": [
            "fille",
            "filles"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "filles"
          ],
          "why": "Des = pluriel indéfini → filles."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-03-adjectives",
      "order": 3,
      "title": "Согласование прилагательных",
      "subtitle": "Accord: genre et nombre",
      "topics": [
        "adjectifs_qualificatifs",
        "accord"
      ],
      "prereq": [
        "a1-01-genre-nombre"
      ],
      "minutes": 15,
      "theory": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Прилагательное согласуется с существительным по роду и числу. Базовая форма = masculin singulier."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Общие правила",
          "text": "Féminin: +e (grand → grande). Pluriel: +s (grand → grands). Féminin pluriel: +es (grandes)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Особые случаи",
          "text": "-x → -se (heureux/heureuse), -f → -ve (neuf/neuve), -er → -ère (premier/première), doubles consonnes + e (gentil/gentille)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "ref": "adjectives_agreement"
        }
      ],
      "drills": [
        {
          "id": "a1-03-d01",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Une ____ (grand) maison.",
          "options": [
            "grand",
            "grande",
            "grands",
            "grandes"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "grande"
          ],
          "why": "Maison = féminin singulier → +e."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-03-d02",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Des ____ (petit) enfants.",
          "options": [
            "petit",
            "petite",
            "petits",
            "petites"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "petits"
          ],
          "why": "Enfants = masculin pluriel → +s."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-03-d03",
          "type": "fill",
          "prompt": "Une ____ (heureux) fille.",
          "answer": [
            "heureuse"
          ],
          "why": "-x → -se au féminin."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-03-d04",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Des ____ (neuf) voitures.",
          "options": [
            "neuf",
            "neuve",
            "neufs",
            "neuves"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "neuves"
          ],
          "why": "-f → -ve + s au féminin pluriel."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-04-present-er",
      "order": 4,
      "title": "Présent: глаголы на -er (parler, aimer, manger)",
      "subtitle": "Регулярное спряжение 1-й группы",
      "topics": [
        "present_er"
      ],
      "prereq": [
        "a1-02-articles"
      ],
      "minutes": 15,
      "theory": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Глаголы на -er (1-я группа) — самые регулярные. Основа = инфинитив без -er. Окончания: -e, -es, -e, -ons, -ez, -ent."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Спряжение parler",
          "text": "je parle, tu parles, il/elle/on parle, nous parlons, vous parlez, ils/elles parlent. 3 формы звучат одинаково: parle/parles/parle."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Орфографические особенности",
          "text": "manger → nous mangeons (сохраняем e). commencer → je commence (ç перед o/a/u). acheter → j'achète (accent grave)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "ref": "present_er"
        }
      ],
      "drills": [
        {
          "id": "a1-04-d01",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Nous ____ (parler) français.",
          "options": [
            "parle",
            "parles",
            "parlons",
            "parlez"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "parlons"
          ],
          "why": "Nous → -ons."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-04-d02",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Ils ____ (aimer) le chocolat.",
          "options": [
            "aime",
            "aimes",
            "aimons",
            "aiment"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "aiment"
          ],
          "why": "Ils → -ent."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-04-d03",
          "type": "fill",
          "prompt": "Je ____ (manger) une pomme.",
          "answer": [
            "mange"
          ],
          "why": "Je → -e."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-04-d04",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Tu ____ (commencer) à comprendre.",
          "options": [
            "commence",
            "commences",
            "commençons",
            "commencez"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "commences"
          ],
          "why": "Tu → -es. ç сохраняется."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-05-present-irregular",
      "order": 5,
      "title": "Présent: être, avoir, aller, faire, venir",
      "subtitle": "Основные неправильные глаголы",
      "topics": [
        "etre_avoir",
        "aller_faire_venir"
      ],
      "prereq": [
        "a1-04-present-er"
      ],
      "minutes": 15,
      "theory": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Être (быть) и avoir (иметь) — вспомогательные для составных времен. Aller (идти), faire (делать), venir (приходить) — высокочастотные неправильные."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Être / Avoir",
          "text": "Être: suis, es, est, sommes, êtes, sont. Avoir: ai, as, a, avons, avez, ont."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Aller / Faire / Venir",
          "text": "Aller: vais, vas, va, allons, allez, vont. Faire: fais, fais, fait, faisons, faites, font. Venir: viens, viens, vient, venons, venez, viennent."
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "ref": "etre_avoir_present"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "ref": "aller_faire_venir_present"
        }
      ],
      "drills": [
        {
          "id": "a1-05-d01",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Je ____ (être) content.",
          "options": [
            "suis",
            "es",
            "est",
            "ai"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "suis"
          ],
          "why": "Je suis (être)."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-05-d02",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Ils ____ (avoir) une voiture.",
          "options": [
            "ont",
            "sont",
            "avez",
            "êtes"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "ont"
          ],
          "why": "Ils ont (avoir)."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-05-d03",
          "type": "fill",
          "prompt": "Nous ____ (aller) à Paris.",
          "answer": [
            "allons"
          ],
          "why": "Nous allons (aller)."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-05-d04",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Tu ____ (faire) du sport.",
          "options": [
            "fais",
            "fait",
            "font",
            "faisons"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "fais"
          ],
          "why": "Tu fais (faire)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-06-negation",
      "order": 6,
      "title": "Отрицание: ne...pas, ne...jamais, ne...rien",
      "subtitle": "Позиция частиц, сокращение ne → n'",
      "topics": [
        "negation"
      ],
      "prereq": [
        "a1-05-present-irregular"
      ],
      "minutes": 12,
      "theory": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Французское отрицание — две части: ne перед глаголом, вторая часть после. ne → n' перед гласной/молчащим h."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Основные пары",
          "text": "ne...pas (не), ne...jamais (никогда), ne...rien (ничего), ne...personne (никто), ne...plus (больше не), ne...ni...ni (ни...ни)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Порядок со местоимениями",
          "text": "ne + me/te/le/la/les/lui/leur/y/en + verbe + pas/jamais/rien..."
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "ref": "negation_basic"
        }
      ],
      "drills": [
        {
          "id": "a1-06-d01",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Je ____ sais pas.",
          "options": [
            "ne",
            "n'",
            "pas",
            "ne pas"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "n'"
          ],
          "why": "Ne → n' перед гласной (sais)."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-06-d02",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Il ne vient ____ .",
          "options": [
            "pas",
            "jamais",
            "rien",
            "personne"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "jamais"
          ],
          "why": "Jamais = никогда."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-06-d03",
          "type": "fill",
          "prompt": "Nous ne voyons ____ .",
          "answer": [
            "rien"
          ],
          "why": "Rien = ничего."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-06-d04",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Elle ne connaît ____ .",
          "options": [
            "pas",
            "plus",
            "personne",
            "rien"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "personne"
          ],
          "why": "Personne = никто (только для людей)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-07-questions",
      "order": 7,
      "title": "Вопросы: интонация, est-ce que, инверсия",
      "subtitle": "Три способа задать вопрос",
      "topics": [
        "questions"
      ],
      "prereq": [
        "a1-06-negation"
      ],
      "minutes": 12,
      "theory": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Три способа: 1) Интонация (Tu viens? — только устно). 2) Est-ce que (Est-ce que tu viens?). 3) Инверсия (Viens-tu? — формально/письменно)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Est-ce que",
          "text": "Универсальный способ. Est-ce que + утвердительное предложение. Est-ce qu'il vient? (elision)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Инверсия",
          "text": "Глагол + дефис + подлежащее (приonominal). Parles-tu français? Avec voyelle: -t- (Parle-t-il?)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "ref": "question_formation"
        }
      ],
      "drills": [
        {
          "id": "a1-07-d01",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "____ tu viens demain?",
          "options": [
            "Est-ce que",
            "Viens",
            "Tu viens",
            "Que"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "Est-ce que"
          ],
          "why": "Est-ce que + подлежащее + глагол."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-07-d02",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Parles-tu anglais? — Это ____ .",
          "options": [
            "интонация",
            "est-ce que",
            "инверсия",
            "не вопрос"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "инверсия"
          ],
          "why": "Глагол + дефис + подлежащее."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-07-d03",
          "type": "fill",
          "prompt": "____ -il français? (Parler)",
          "answer": [
            "Parle-t-il"
          ],
          "why": "Инверсия с -t- для еуфонии."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-07-d04",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Tu parles français? (интонация) — это ____ .",
          "options": [
            "формально",
            "только устно",
            "письменно",
            "ошибка"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "только устно"
          ],
          "why": "Интонационный вопрос — только в разговорной речи."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-08-prepositions",
      "order": 8,
      "title": "Базовые предлоги: à, de, en, dans, sur, sous, avec, sans",
      "subtitle": "Место, направление, способ, сопровождение",
      "topics": [
        "prepositions_basic"
      ],
      "prereq": [
        "a1-07-questions"
      ],
      "minutes": 15,
      "theory": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Предлоги не склоняются, но сокращаются с артиклями. à + le = au, à + les = aux. de + le = du, de + les = des."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "География",
          "text": "Города: à Paris, de Paris. Страны (f): en France, de France. Страны (m, на согласную): au Japon, du Japon. Страны (m, на гласную): en Iran, d'Iran."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Место/Направление",
          "text": "dans (внутри), sur (на), sous (под), avec (с), sans (без)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "ref": "prepositions_geo"
        }
      ],
      "drills": [
        {
          "id": "a1-08-d01",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Je vais ____ Paris.",
          "options": [
            "à",
            "au",
            "en",
            "dans"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "à"
          ],
          "why": "Город → à."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-08-d02",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Il revient ____ France.",
          "options": [
            "de",
            "du",
            "de la",
            "d'"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "de"
          ],
          "why": "Страна женского рода → de."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-08-d03",
          "type": "fill",
          "prompt": "Nous habitons ____ Japon.",
          "answer": [
            "au"
          ],
          "why": "Страна м.р. на согласную → au (à + le)."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-08-d04",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Le chat est ____ la table.",
          "options": [
            "dans",
            "sur",
            "sous",
            "avec"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "sur"
          ],
          "why": "На столе → sur."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-09-partitive",
      "order": 9,
      "title": "Частичный артикль: du, de la, de l', des",
      "subtitle": "Некоторое количество неисчисляемых существительных",
      "topics": [
        "partitive"
      ],
      "prereq": [
        "a1-08-prepositions"
      ],
      "minutes": 12,
      "theory": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Частичный артикль выражает неопределённое количество: du pain, de l'eau, des pommes. ОБЯЗАТЕЛЕН во французском (в русском родительный падеж: хлеба, воды)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Формы",
          "text": "du (m sg), de la (f sg), de l' (devant voyelle/h muet), des (pl)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "После отрицания",
          "text": "Je ne mange pas **de** pain (не du!). Частичный исчезает → de/d'."
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "ref": "articles_partitive"
        }
      ],
      "drills": [
        {
          "id": "a1-09-d01",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Je veux ____ pain.",
          "options": [
            "du",
            "de la",
            "de l'",
            "un"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "du"
          ],
          "why": "Pain = m sg → du."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-09-d02",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Elle boit ____ eau.",
          "options": [
            "du",
            "de la",
            "de l'",
            "des"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "de l'"
          ],
          "why": "Eau = f sg, voyelle → de l'."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-09-d03",
          "type": "fill",
          "prompt": "Nous achetons ____ pommes.",
          "answer": [
            "des"
          ],
          "why": "Pommes = pl → des."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-09-d04",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Je ne mange ____ pain.",
          "options": [
            "du",
            "de",
            "de la",
            "des"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "de"
          ],
          "why": "После отрицания частичный → de."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-10-possessives",
      "order": 10,
      "title": "Притяжательные: mon/ma/mes, ton/ta/tes...",
      "subtitle": "Согласование с ПРИНАДЛЕЖНОСТЮ (не с владельцем!)",
      "topics": [
        "possessives"
      ],
      "prereq": [
        "a1-03-adjectives"
      ],
      "minutes": 12,
      "theory": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Притяжательные согласуются с ОБЪЕКТОМ владения (как прилагательные), а выбор базовой формы зависит от ВЛАДЕЛЬЦА."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Таблица",
          "text": "mon/ma/mes (je), ton/ta/tes (tu), son/sa/ses (il/elle), notre/notre/nos (nous), votre/votre/vos (vous), leur/leur/leurs (ils/elles)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Mon/ton/son перед женским на гласную",
          "text": "mon amie (не *ma amie*), ton école, son histoire — для еуфонии."
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "ref": "possessives"
        }
      ],
      "drills": [
        {
          "id": "a1-10-d01",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "____ (mon) ami est ici.",
          "options": [
            "Mon",
            "Ma",
            "Mes"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "Mon"
          ],
          "why": "Ami = m sg → mon."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-10-d02",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "____ (ma) amie est gentille.",
          "options": [
            "Mon",
            "Ma",
            "Mes"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "Mon"
          ],
          "why": "Amie = f sg, voyelle → mon (euphonie)."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-10-d03",
          "type": "fill",
          "prompt": "____ (notre) voiture est rouge.",
          "answer": [
            "Notre"
          ],
          "why": "Voiture = f sg → notre (инвариант)."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-10-d04",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "____ (leur) enfants dorment.",
          "options": [
            "Leur",
            "Leurs"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "Leurs"
          ],
          "why": "Enfants = pl → leurs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-11-demonstratives",
      "order": 11,
      "title": "Указательные: ce/cet/cette/ces",
      "subtitle": "Ce livre, cet ami, cette table, ces livres",
      "topics": [
        "demonstratives"
      ],
      "prereq": [
        "a1-10-possessives"
      ],
      "minutes": 10,
      "theory": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Указательные согласуются с существительным. Cet перед гласной/молчащим h = ce + t (euphonie)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Формы",
          "text": "ce (m sg), cet (m sg + voyelle/h), cette (f sg), ces (pl)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "title": "Усиление: -ci / -là",
          "text": "ce livre-ci (здесь), ce livre-là (там)."
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "ref": "demonstratives"
        }
      ],
      "drills": [
        {
          "id": "a1-11-d01",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "____ (ce) ami est sympa.",
          "options": [
            "Ce",
            "Cet",
            "Cette",
            "Ces"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "Cet"
          ],
          "why": "Ami = m sg, voyelle → cet."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-11-d02",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "____ (cette) maison est grande.",
          "options": [
            "Ce",
            "Cet",
            "Cette",
            "Ces"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "Cette"
          ],
          "why": "Maison = f sg → cette."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-11-d03",
          "type": "fill",
          "prompt": "____ (ces) livres sont à moi.",
          "answer": [
            "Ces"
          ],
          "why": "Livres = pl → ces."
        },
        {
          "id": "a1-11-d04",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "____ (ce) homme dort.",
          "options": [
            "Ce",
            "Cet",
            "Cette",
            "Ces"
          ],
          "answer": [
            "Cet"
          ],
          "why": "Homme = m sg, h muet → cet."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-12-numbers-time",
      "order": 12,
      "title": "Числа, время, даты",
      "subtitle": "0-100, l'heure, la date",
      "topics": [
